"value":4,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4580860","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1846651706691307","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is now LIVE and the Plaza is open! 🎉","summary":"Until October 26th, Papaya Plaza is part of Steam Next Fest - and you can try out our updated demo now! We have a host of exciting new features, including: Controller support updated across the game (with recently added PS5 controller compatibility). Asian language localisation. New music and dynamic SFX throughout. New Jack quest and quest type (get some hot sauce!) A new character for you to meet. Some characters might give you a gift when you talk to them. Various UX and QOL fixes, including ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1846651706674226","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Papaya Plaza is part of Steam Next Fest! 🎉","summary":"We are super excited to share that Papaya Plaza is officially participating in Steam Next Fest from October 19th - 26th! To celebrate this, we have just dropped our brand new demo for you all to try! New features: Controller support updated across the game. New character (Pudding!) New critter to catch. New music and updated dynamic SFX throughout. New Jack quest and quest type (get some hot sauce!) Some characters might give you a gift when you talk to them. Various UX and QOL fixes, including ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674226","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1846018067940504","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Diary #3","summary":"Peep peep, Mayors! 🍍 Here’s a little look at what we’ve been working on the past week. Coming Soon New Music & Audio Polish Your ears are in for a treat! We’ve overhauled the audio experience to make exploring the world feel much more immersive: Ocean Ambiance: Next time you stroll down to the coast, you’ll hear soothing, dynamic ocean loops. Day to Night: The soundtrack now seamlessly transitions between Day and Night to match the vibe! Footsteps: Walking around feels much more responsive - ste","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:08:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940504","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1845383656392912","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Diary #2","summary":"Peep peep, Mayors! 🍍 Huge thanks to everyone who joined our recent closed playtest! We’ve loved reading all your feedback. We’re already hard at work polishing systems, fixing bugs, and improving the overall experience! It's been lovely to see how your towns are coming along... {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46140022/e557bf87f0ee4274c2db7d1fe8abfab70bdcaeb5.png {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46140022/f3ed49dd290aa1225edeb095a0e0386873a0176d.png Credit: LittleBun Coming Soon Controller Support First off, a quick win: co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T09:01:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1845383656377531","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you, Playtesters...","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46140022/ff407ad8ccda1b3f769bd6fde1db5c7e7f3d3f95.png We want to extend a huge thank you to our community for jumping in and playing Papaya Plaza. Your feedback is crucial to making this game great, so if you haven't shared your thoughts yet, please leave them over in Discord. We're reading everything and working hard to improve your experience. We'd love for you to post a screenshot of your town on socials (don't forget to tag us!) or in Discord, and we'd be super grateful if","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T13:02:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1845383656377462","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Diary #1","summary":"Peep peep, Mayors! 🍍It's been a busy few weeks behind the scenes here at the Plaza, and we thought it was high time we threw open the doors to the workshop and showed you what we've been up to! Some of this is shiny and brand new and some of it is very much still in the oven. Let's dive in!Coming SoonNew VillagersThere's a new face wandering the Plaza! Say hello to Pudding, a cute pup who loves to party and is all about sharing good vibes only 🎉We've got a brand new character design to show off,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:40:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377462","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1842846814440661","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"update","title":"Second Closed Playtest & Controller Update 🎮 Players Needed!","summary":"Peep peep! The Plaza needs YOU!A big thank you to all those who took part in the first closed playtest for Papaya Plaza. Thanks to your feedback, new features were added to the latest demo (check our Wholesome Games post to see what they were!). We're now looking to open the playtest back up again from the 16th to the 30th of September! Play testers will get early hands-on time with Papaya Plaza, helping us test gameplay, try out new features, and squash any pesky bugs. Controller players, rejoi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T15:13:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440661","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1840310314341826","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Papaya Plaza is in the Wholesome Games Celebration! 🌴🍉","summary":"We are thrilled to announce that Papaya Plaza is participating in the Wholesome Games Celebration on Steam, running from August 6–13! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46140022/4a3467083f0f9132b2bca31531323a83a548e6a0.png To celebrate, we’ve just released a freshly updated demo! Step back into the plaza and experience: ✨ A host of brand-new features 🐛 Quality-of-life improvements and bug fixes Whether you're visiting for the first time or returning to see what’s new, we’d love for you to check it out and share","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T13:01:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341826","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1838407329269609","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Testers Needed!","summary":"Peep peep! The Plaza is under construction We're gearing up for our very first closed beta, and we're on the hunt for a handful of mayors to help us get the town ready. Beta testers will get early hands-on time with Papaya Plaza, helping us test gameplay, try out new features, and squash any pesky bugs.Please note that this beta is PC only (keyboard & mouse), and selected testers will be asked to keep beta content under wraps until we're ready to share more publicly. Spots are limited, so sign u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T17:25:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329269609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1835871199313916","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"update","title":"Minor Update - Readability and Pickups Stability","summary":"Hi everyone! A few of you mentioned occasional issues with broken pickups in the game - we dug around and added a fix so pickups don't overshoot their movement when fps is low. We also noticed a couple of folks giving us feedback about readability of the dialogue text, so we've pushed a minor update adjusting the contrast and dialogue background opacity for characters. Let us know what you think! Thanks again for keeping us up to date with your feedback Remember you can always jump into our disc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T20:15:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199313916","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1835236783561231","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for 10,000 Wishlists!","summary":"Hello friends! We are absolutely bowled over by reaching this milestone. As a tiny indie team, we’ve put a lot of heart and soul into creating Papaya Plaza and we’re very pleased that you like what you’ve seen. We’ve been hearing your feedback on the demo and are working hard to catch bugs and having discussions behind the scenes on creating the best possible Papaya Plaza we can make. In the meantime, you can join our Discord and tell us what you think! It’s a friendly place, and we share behind","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T17:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783561231","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1834602721197183","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"update","title":"Wholesome direct - Demo Update Patch","summary":"Hello folks! Whew what an amazing Wholesome Direct. So many great games. Big love to everyone who's taken the time to play our demo and for everyone who's given us feedback so far.We noticed a few folks reporting bugs to us which we were able to quickly find and patch, so we wanted to get this build out as soon as possible. This update addresses the following issues: Game resolution and cursor position are correct for players who have their computer's display scale larger than 100%URLs open in t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T22:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197183","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1834602721194211","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Play Papaya Plaza Presently (Pretty Please, Peep Peep!) 🍍","summary":"Hey friends! We’re so pleased to have announced, as part of Wholesome Direct, this afternoon our playable demo for Papaya Plaza! Apart from meeting adorable characters and sprucing up a little town, expect to find the cute, the weird and the wonderful like: A talking pumpkin (we don’t know how he’s alive and will not be taking questions at this time)Haikus about a gardenA Confused WatermelonStrangely valuable PapayasThis guy 👇Plus, you might find some secrets like: Children with a cursory awaren","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T17:00:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4580030-1833968530885530","game_id":"steam-4580030","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing Papaya Plaza 🥭","summary":"Howdy one and all, Without further ado, allow us to present… Papaya Plaza. Papaya Plaza started out with characters from our wonderfully-talented Stef Bollen’s art, and has grown into a slice of life town building game that we’re super excited to be revealing today! In Papaya Plaza, you’ll take on the role of mayor of a small tourist town where you can decorate to your heart’s content. You’ll be helping quirky characters, unlocking new decorations, and gently levelling-up your town as you go for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T14:11:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530885530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4580030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4580030":"2026-10-26T12:54:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4580030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:13Z"},